<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 5.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Villa World	    10.48    1.05</p>
<p> 2   Schroder Intl	  10.37    2.32</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.80    1.00</p>
<p> 4   MT Leyshon Gold	 9.47    2.64</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 9.41    1.08</p>
<p> 6   Indu Property	   9.38    0.97</p>
<p> 7   BT Prop Trust	   9.22    1.77</p>
<p> 8   Aust Tour		 8.82    0.85</p>
<p> 9   Colonial Mutual	 8.81    1.18</p>
