<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.30    0.94</p>
<p>12   Armstrong Retail	8.25    0.80</p>
<p>13   Equitilink		8.20    0.61</p>
<p>14   Barclays Mirvac	 8.15    1.35</p>
